Package: ragnar-taskbar
Version: 0.3.12
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libgtk4-layer-shell0
Maintainer: Ragnar <info@lieraos.local>
Description: Ragnar-native Wayland taskbar
 Independent layer-shell taskbar for Ragnar/LieraOS: start menu with
 categories and session actions, running-window list with live
 previews, workspace switcher, system tray, clock/calendar,
 notification bell, hardware sensor applets and user-defined command
 applets — per-bar edge, geometry, applets, opacity and colour, all
 configurable via the built-in settings window.
